[10.889376, "o", "--- forms.txt ---\r\n"]
[10.890724, "o", "Heap card (text):\r\n\r\nHPK1\r\nNODE <id> <class> <bytes>\r\nEDGE <from> <to> KIND <field>\r\nROOT <id> <rootKind>\r\nSITE <id>\r\nEND\r\n\r\nKIND is STRONG or WEAK.\r\nA retaining chain uses STRONG edges only.\r\nPATH is hop labels of a shortest retaining chain from a ROOT to the SITE.\r\nWhen several STRONG hops reach SITE, PATH uses the class.field of the STRONG hop into SITE.\r\n\r\nLedger lines, SITE class ascending:\r\n\r\nSITE <class>\r\nBYTES <n>\r\nPATH <rootKind>><Class>.<field>>...><Class>.<field>\r\n\r\nalign writes /app/inkurn/align.txt\r\n  lock\r\nor\r\n  slip\r\n"]
[10.891177, "o", "--- BAY.txt ---\r\n"]
[10.892401, "o", "Pipeline modules:\r\n\r\n- /app/rootwell\r\n- /app/adjmill\r\n- /app/softbay\r\n\r\nCLI lives under /app/millarm. Rebuild with /app/kindle.sh. Desk also links with make -C /app/millarm -f driver.mk OUT=/tmp/keelgrip.ref.\r\n\r\n`--pin-handles` reorders neighbour lists by object id. Ops turned it on when PATH drifted; SITE and BYTES still matched.\r\n"]
[10.892862, "o", "--- files ---\r\n"]
[10.895886, "o", "/app/adjmill/emit.c\r\n/app/adjmill/emit.h\r\n/app/adjmill/emit_main.c\r\n/app/bin/keelgrip\r\n/app/deskcue/BAY.txt\r\n/app/deskcue/forms.txt\r\n/app/inkurn/live.txt\r\n/app/inkurn/mint.ok\r\n/app/kindle.sh\r\n/app/millarm/driver.c\r\n/app/millarm/driver.mk\r\n/app/millarm/driver.o\r\n/app/millarm/latch.c\r\n/app/millarm/latch.h\r\n/app/millarm/latch.o\r\n/app/millarm/load.c\r\n/app/millarm/load.h\r\n/app/millarm/load.o\r\n/app/packurn/day.hpk\r\n/app/packurn/dusk.hpk\r\n/app/ridget/step.c\r\n/app/ridget/step.h\r\n/app/ridget/step.inc\r\n/app/ridget/step.o\r\n/app/rootwell/scan.c\r\n/app/rootwell/scan.h\r\n/app/rootwell/scan.o\r\n/app/softbay/skip.c\r\n/app/softbay/skip.h\r\n/app/softbay/skip.o\r\n/app/twinline/note.c\r\n/app/twinline/note.h\r\n/app/twinline/note.o\r\n"]
